     "text": "{\"count\": 1, \"rationale\": \"With no blocks, the target is reachable: edge0 and edge1 give h1_0:traverse, then h3_2:pivot, then h5_1:reach, then crown:obtain. So at least one block is needed. Blocking h1_0:traverse is enough. It cuts h3_2:pivot and therefore h5_1:reach. It is also a required parent of the AND step h2_2:traverse, whose loss cuts h4_2:reach. Without h4_2:reach, the AND step h5_0:pivot fails. Both parents of crown:obtain are then unreachable, so the minimum is 1.\"}"
